                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Conger to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Pekin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-12-30"><hi rendition="#italic">December 30,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Conger reports that the Chinese plenipotentiaries have notified the
                    ministers that the Emperor decrees acceptance of the demands of the powers as a
                    whole and requests further conference. The plenipotentiaries also ask that
                    military excursions in the interior cease. Mr. Conger thinks they should cease
                    at once.)</p>
            </div>
